  "translation": "Gomme Khanamele, mora wa mmatla wa ka, a tla go nna, jaaka lentšu la Yahwe, sekhurung sa kgolego ya batedi, gomme a re go nna: Reka ⟨ke kgopela⟩ ⟨את⟩ tšimo ya ka yeo e lego Anatote, yeo e lego lefaseng la Benyamine, gobane go wena go lego kahlolo ya boswa, gomme go wena go bušetša; reka go wena. Gomme nka tseba gore ke lentšu la Yahwe.",
